Package: liblingmoapplets1
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Lingmo Desktop applet framework (runtime)
 Provides the Lingmo::Applet base class and AppletHost for loading
 applet plugins into panel and desktop surface processes.

Package: liblingmoapplets-dev
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: liblingmoapplets1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: Lingmo Desktop applet framework (development files)
 Headers and CMake targets for developing applets against the
 Lingmo applet framework.

Package: lingmo-applets
Architecture: any
Depends: liblingmoapplets1 (= ${binary:Version}), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Lingmo Desktop built-in applets
 Built-in panel applets: Application Menu, Task Manager, System Tray,
 Digital Clock, Battery, Volume, Network Indicator, Quick Settings,
 Spacer, and Separator.
